   "jobExcerpt": "We Make Remote Work Remarkable • TopTalent from LatAm Hello! We are GoFasti, a Talent-as-a-Service. GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. We need an English-proficient PART-TIME Lead Developer / Architect Web3, based in no, available to work remotely. We are looking for someone with&hellip;",
   "jobDescription": "<p><strong>We Make Remote Work Remarkable</strong><strong> • TopTalent from LatAm</strong></p>\r\n<p>Hello! We are <strong><a href=\"https://jobicy.com/company/gofasti\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GoFasti</a>, </strong>a Talent-as-a-Service. GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. </p>\r\n<p>We need an English-proficient<strong> PART-TIME Lead Developer / Architect Web3</strong>, based in no, available to work remotely.</p>\r\n<p>We are looking for someone with exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, who embraces changes while maintaining strong attention to detail. An interested and proactive person, who's constantly learning and improving their skills.</p>\r\n<p>Are you the one we are looking for?</p>\r\n<p><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Own the technical architecture of the platform and guide key build decisions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Lead and orchestrate the existing development team through sprint cycles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Drive hands-on full-stack development alongside the team</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Implement and oversee wallet integrations, transaction safety, and security best practices on Solana</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ensure game logic and mechanics (poker, slots, fantasy sports) are built to industry standards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>At least 2 years of experience as a Lead Developer or Software Architect on production platforms, preferably in gaming or blockchain payment projects.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 2 years of full-stack development experience.</li>\r\n<li>Hands-on Solana experience (must-have).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Must have gaming industry experience</strong>, preferably in casino games, poker, or slots.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Must have blockchain experience</strong>, ideally in security, payments, or transactions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Must have experience leading development projects</strong>, preferably in gaming or blockchain payment systems.</li>\r\n<li>Blockchain gaming experience is a plus but not required.</li>\r\n<li>Excellent English communication skills.</li>\r\n<li>Available immediately for part-time, project-based work with long-term potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>It's a plus:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Rust and/or Anchor framework experience (Solana smart contracts)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>TypeScript/JavaScript with React or Next.js</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Experience with provably fair game mechanics / RNG systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Compensation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The salary range offered for this part-time position varies from (USD) $2,000 - $3,000 per month, depending on seniority and skillset.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>This position is for a part time contract, through a payroll platform.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The talent will work remotely allocated at our client.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Here are the steps for this process:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Application review/approval <strong>&gt;</strong> Screening interview with GoFasti's team <strong>&gt;</strong> We build and send your profile to our client <strong>&gt;</strong> Profile review/approval by client <strong>&gt;</strong> Interview with the client <strong>&gt;</strong> Hiring and onboarding.</p>\r\n<p>Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process. </p>\r\n<p><strong>Note for Candidates Approached Directly:</strong><br>If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. </p>\r\n<p>Thank you!</p>",
   "pubDate": "2026-10-17T06:55:52+00:00",
   "salaryMin": 2000,
   "salaryMax": 3000,
   "salaryCurrency": "USD",
   "salaryPeriod": "monthly"
  },
