   "jobLevel": "Senior",
   "jobExcerpt": "We Make Remote Work Remarkable • TopTalent from LatAm Hello! We are GoFasti, a Talent-as-a-Service. GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. We need an English-fluent Sales Development Representative with exceptional relationship-building skills and a believe it's possible mindset, who never stops improving, and is&hellip;",
   "jobDescription": "<p><strong>We Make Remote Work Remarkable</strong><strong> • TopTalent from LatAm</strong></p>\r\n<p>Hello! We are <strong><a href=\"https://jobicy.com/company/gofasti\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GoFasti</a>, </strong>a Talent-as-a-Service. GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. </p>\r\n<p>We need an English-fluent <strong>Sales Development Representative</strong> with exceptional relationship-building skills and a believe it's possible mindset, who never stops improving, and is constantly learning the customer and giving the product team feedback, available to work remotely.</p>\r\n<p>Are you the professional we are looking for?</p>\r\n<p>Key responsibilities</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lead capture and prospecting</li>\r\n<li>Search accounts, identify the main points of contact, and generate interest.</li>\r\n<li>Prospect new deals, open market to Account Executives</li>\r\n<li>Contacting potential clients through calls, both warm and cold, and emails</li>\r\n<li>Communicate our value proposition in a pitch to potential customers</li>\r\n<li>Proactively seek new business opportunities in the market</li>\r\n<li>Set up meetings or calls between (prospective) clients and Account Executives</li>\r\n<li>Provide feedback to management on the effectiveness of outbound phone and email campaigns</li>\r\n<li>Create and maintain a database of contacts of current and future customers</li>\r\n<li>Data entry of prospect and contact data in the CRM database</li>\r\n<li>Engage with your prospects to build trusted relationships by providing insights tailored to their specific needs and interests</li>\r\n<li>Serve as day-to-day contact for assigned accounts, building trust and rapport while identifying areas of opportunity, highlighting best practices, and documenting them</li>\r\n<li>Review the customer journey, identifying how it’s supported, taking a consultative approach in helping clients overcome issues and achieve goals</li>\r\n<li>Facilitate interaction and workflow between project team members, including third-party service providers, to ensure deliverables are on time</li>\r\n<li>Collaborate, problem solve, and/or strategize upcoming client meetings with team members</li>\r\n<li>Prepare necessary documentation or visuals for client to demonstrate performance of campaigns; analyze trends in C-Sat/NPS scores to identify areas of improvement</li>\r\n<li>Work with the sales and marketing team to drill customer references and develop case studies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Key Qualifications</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Full English proficiency</strong> is essential</li>\r\n<li>1-2 years <strong>technology staff augmentation</strong> sales work experience or 1-3 years of experience in communications, marketing, sales, account management, or customer success.</li>\r\n<li>Experience selling to the US market (preferred).</li>\r\n<li>Experience in cold calling.</li>\r\n<li>Strong desire to be in technology and staff augmentation sales.</li>\r\n<li>You have a passion for talent-as-a-service.</li>\r\n<li>You are relentless in pursuing goals and solving problems.</li>\r\n<li>You are friendly, enthusiastic, and have professional communication skills.</li>\r\n<li>Ability to take initiative, prioritize, and manage time effectively.</li>\r\n<li>Strong verbal and written communication, strategic planning, and project management skills.</li>\r\n<li>Comfortable working across multiple departments.</li>\r\n<li>Active team player, self-starter, and multitasker who can quickly adjust priorities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Compensation:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The type of contract is a full-time Independent Contractor through a payroll platform.</li>\r\n<li>This position has a trial period of 3 months. We are looking for SDRs to join our team in the long run, and this initial trial is an adaptation period.</li>\r\n<li>The salary range for this position includes commissions, and the final compensation will be determined based on experience, seniority, and qualifications.</li>\r\n<li>The commission structure will be discussed during the interviews. </li>\r\n<li>The developer will work REMOTELY, directly with The GoFasti Team. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Here are the steps for this process:</p>\r\n<p>Application review/approval &gt; interview with GoFasti's team &gt; profile review/approval by GoFasti Executives &gt; Second interview &gt; hiring and onboarding. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process. </p>\r\n<p><strong>Note for Candidates Approached Directly:</strong><br>If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. </p>\r\n<p>Thank you!</p>",
   "pubDate": "2026-10-17T06:55:52+00:00"
  },
